     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if toSkip is negative
     * @see InputStream#skip(long)
     * @see <a href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IO-203">IO-203 - Add skipFully() method for InputStreams</a>
     * @since 2.0
