     * a.txt        --&gt; ""
     * a/b/c        --&gt; a/b/
     * a/b/c/       --&gt; a/b/c/
     * </pre>
     * <p>
     * The output will be the same irrespective of the machine that the code is running on.
     * </p>
     * <p>
     * This method drops the prefix from the result.
     * See {@link #getFullPath(String)} for the method that retains the prefix.
