 * <pre>
 *       File[] array = ...
 *       ((AbstractFileComparator) SizeFileComparator.SIZE_REVERSE).sort(array);
 * </pre>
 * <p>
 * <strong>N.B.</strong> Directories are treated as <b>zero size</b> unless
 * <code>sumDirectoryContents</code> is {@code true}.
 *
 * @since 1.4
